# The built overlay-v1 package IS tracked: it is the only way a user can get a
# bitstream onto their board without opening a terminal, and the backend image
# copies it straight out of this directory. Synthesis needs Linux + Vivado
# 2022.x, so requiring every user to run `scripts/build_overlay.sh` was never a
# real option. ~4.4 MB, replaced only when the overlay contract changes.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!snn_overlay.bit
!snn_overlay.hwh
!overlay_manifest.json
